<section class="steps-section" id="procedure-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <header class="section-header" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Double Currency Net Worth Certificate Process in Mumbai</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Our CA team issues UDIN-backed dual-currency certificates with same-day delivery from Patron's Marine Lines office - centrally located between RBI (Fort) and US Consulate/SEBI (BKC).</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 1</span><h3 class="step-title">Identify Target Country and Currency</h3><p class="step-description">Determine foreign currency based on visa destination: Canada=CAD, US=USD, UK=GBP, Australia=AUD, Schengen=EUR, Gulf=AED. Patron confirms the correct currency, checks current RBI reference rate, and identifies embassy-specific format (individual/family/sponsored).</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Currency confirmed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>RBI rate checked</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="60" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="35" y="35" font-size="10" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">INR</text><text x="60" y="45" font-size="12" fill="#E8712C" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">+</text><text x="85" y="35" font-size="10" fill="#E8712C" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">USD</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Currency</span><span class="step-number-large">01</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 2</span><h3 class="step-title">Compile Asset and Liability Documents</h3><p class="step-description">Gather bank statements, DEMAT CAS, property documents with Ready Reckoner rate, gold receipts, vehicle RC, insurance, PPF/NPS/EPF, all loan statements, ITR, passport. For student sponsors, both parents' documents. Submit at Marine Lines office or via secure email.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>All accounts</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Ready Reckoner</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="10" y="10" width="45" height="60" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="65" y="10" width="45" height="60" rx="4" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1.2"/><text x="32" y="45" font-size="8" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Assets</text><text x="87" y="45" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Liabilities</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Documents</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 3</span><h3 class="step-title">CA Verification and Asset Valuation</h3><p class="step-description">CA independently verifies every document - bank balances cross-checked, DEMAT confirmed from depository, Mumbai property valued at Ready Reckoner rate (Maharashtra government stamp duty valuation). Each asset and liability confirmed before conversion.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Independent verification</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Maha Ready Reckoner</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="10" width="80" height="60" rx="6" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="60" cy="35" r="15" fill="none" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M53 35l5 5 10-10" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Verify</span><span class="step-number-large">03</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 4</span><h3 class="step-title">RBI Reference Rate Conversion</h3><p class="step-description">On certification date, CA sources official RBI reference rate. USD/GBP/EUR/JPY: direct rate. CAD/AUD/SGD/NZD/AED: cross-rate via USD. Every line item converted individually. Rate source (RBI), date documented on certificate. Never Google/market/bank selling rates.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>rbi.org.in rate</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Line-by-line conversion</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="60" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="32" font-size="9" fill="#14365F" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">RBI Rate</text><text x="60" y="52" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">INR → CAD/USD/GBP</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">RBI Conversion</span><span class="step-number-large">04</span></div></div></div>
